Package: lifewatt
Title: Explore Community Health Around AI Computing Facilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("lifewatt", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "noreply@github.com")
Description: Links a query location to community health snapshots using
    reproducible geographic identifiers and great-circle distances. Includes
    an Alachua County demonstration, maps, descriptive comparisons and CSV
    export. Outputs describe community context and do not estimate causal
    effects of computing facilities on mortality or life expectancy.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
